  "description": "Trident Convertible – The Ultimate Adjustable Tandem & Triplet Bike\nThe Trident Convertible is the perfect blend of versatility and adjustability, designed with family-friendly PeriScope technology and S+S frame couplers for easy transport. Whether you're packing it into a vehicle or shipping it for travel, this convertible tandem/triplet bike offers seamless adaptability.\nUnlike our Co-Pilot frame option, the Trident Convertible isn’t designed for airline-checkable luggage. However, its modular frame design lets you switch between a two-rider tandem or a three-rider triplet, making it an ideal choice for growing families or group adventures. And, all of this at a very affordable price.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 26” wheels with 30-40mm tires for a smooth ride\n\nCo-Motion zonally-butted chromoly tubing for durability and performance\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for enhanced stability\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for confident, long-distance riding\n\nSuper-low standover clearance to accommodate smaller riders\n\nRack & fender mounts for ultimate touring convenience\n\nPowerful dual disc brakes for superior stopping power\n\nShimano 105 drivetrain for reliable, smooth shifting\n\nHand-built touring wheels designed for strength and longevity\n\nWhether you're cruising as a duo or riding as a trio, the Trident Convertible ensures a comfortable, stable, and adventure-ready ride for every journey.\n\nComplete bike starting at $10,995\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your PeriScope Trident Convertible order started!",
